Models with “*” are trained from <span id="S4.T3.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">DeepScaleR-1.5B</span>, while the remaining are from <span id="S4.T3.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">DS-1.5B</span>.
Darker colors in the cell background denote better results.
